This is the pannal optimized fork of Realtek 9.018, based on awesometic commit
9a152bf920334aead090d2fb4d91f67a84923123 and selected ewaldc 9.014 concepts.
Driver changes were independently reviewed and compile-tested at f07eec4;
subsequent packaging changes add a module version suffix, not a new datapath.

scripts/build-packages.sh constructs a pristine tree from debian/source-manifest,
then a non-native 3.0(quilt) orig tarball and unsigned source/binary packages.
Build products, Git metadata and private context are not inputs. No network,
signing or upload occurs in that script. A verified Launchpad identity/signing
key and separate publication approval are needed before uploading.

Source headers contain GPL-2.0-only SPDX identifiers and historical 'or later'
prose. Notices are preserved; packaging uses the conservative GPL-2 license.
Optional REALWOW source is absent from the baseline; that option stays disabled.
